@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container mt-4">
    <h1 class="display-4">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

    <p class="lead">
        RaceDay is committed to protecting the privacy and personal information
        of event organizers, participants, and visitors who use the platform.
    </p>

    <hr />

    <h3>Information We Collect</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Participant names and contact details.</li>
        <li>Event registration information.</li>
        <li>Category and race participation records.</li>
        <li>Race results and performance history.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>How We Use Your Information</h3>
    <p>
        The information collected is used to:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>Manage event registrations.</li>
        <li>Maintain participant records.</li>
        <li>Record and display race results.</li>
        <li>Improve the RaceDay platform and user experience.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Data Security</h3>
    <p>
        RaceDay implements reasonable security measures to protect user data
        from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.
    </p>

    <h3>Third-Party Services</h3>
    <p>
        Weather information and other external services may be integrated into
        the platform. These services may have their own privacy policies.
    </p>

    <h3>User Rights</h3>
    <p>
        Users may request access to their personal information and request
        corrections where necessary, subject to applicable regulations.
    </p>

    <h3>Contact Us</h3>
    <p>
        For questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact the
        RaceDay administration team.
    </p>

    <div class="alert alert-info mt-4">
        <strong>Note:</strong> This project was developed as part of the
        PROG6212 Portfolio of Evidence (PoE) and is intended for educational
        purposes.
    </div>
</div>
